                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                ""
              ],
              "hash": "X-Amz-Target=AWSGlue.GetSchemaByDefinition"
            },
            "description": "Retrieves a schema by the <code>SchemaDefinition</code>. The schema definition is sent to the Schema Registry, canonicalized, and hashed. If the hash is matched within the scope of the <code>SchemaName</code> or ARN (or the default registry, if none is supplied), that schema\u2019s metadata is returned. Otherwise, a 404 or NotFound error is returned. Schema versions in <code>Deleted</code> statuses will not be included in the results."
          },
